@page "/setup/signin-error"
<PageTitle>Administrator sign-in could not complete</PageTitle>
<main class="aetheric-provisioning setup-shell"><span class="eyebrow">AETHERIC FORGE / PROVISIONING</span>
<h1>Sign-in could not complete.</h1>
<p>Use the Forge administrator account selected during setup. The account must have the configured administrator role in its sign-in token.</p>
<p>If the setup session expired, reconnect with the client secret to resume. If sign-in keeps failing, check the public callback URL and Keycloak client role scopes.</p>
<a href="/setup/administrator">Retry administrator sign-in</a>
<a href="/setup">Reconnect to Keycloak</a>
</main>
